hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"108","[AI-translation] Ham se hadith bayan kiye Muhammad bin Shuja al-Baghdadi ne, ham se hadith bayan kiye Abu Ubaidah al-Haddad ne, Uthman bin Sa'd se, Ibn Sirin se, kehte hain ke main ne apni talwar Samrah bin Jundub ki talwar par banai. Aur Samrah ka da'wa tha ke us ne apni talwar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki talwar par banai thi, aur wo hanifi tha. Ham se hadith bayan kiye Uqbah bin Mukarram al-Basri ne, farmaya: ham se hadith bayan kiye Muhammad bin Bakr ne, Uthman bin Sa'd se, isi sanad se, is jaisi (riwayat)."
"109","[AI-translation] Ham se hadith bayan kiye Abu Sa'id Abdullah bin Sa'id al-Ashajj ne, farmaya: ham se hadith bayan kiye Yunus bin Bukair ne, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Yahya bin Abbad bin Abdullah bin Zubair se, un ke walid se, un ke dad Abdullah bin Zubair se, Zubair bin al-Awwam se, kehte hain ke: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke jisim par Uhud ke din do zireh thin, pas jab aap chatan ki taraf uthne lage toh samwarhe nahi, toh aap ne Talha ko apne niche bithaya, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chadh gaye yahan tak ke chatan par qaim ho gaye, (Zubair) kehte hain: main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Talha ne wajib kar diya."
